{"sections":[{"slug":"K-理论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"K-理论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“K-理论”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论由</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Riemann--Roch定理","text":"Riemann–Roch <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广工作中提出</span>. Atiyah <span lang=\"zh\">和</span> Hirzebruch <span lang=\"zh\">发展了与之类似的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拓扑K-理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑</span> K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/稳定无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">稳定无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">谱</span>"}},{"Plain":" $K(\\mathcal C)$, $\\pi_0K(\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论</span></h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Historically, the <em>algebraic K-theory</em> of a commutative ring (what today is the <strong>“0th” algebraic K-theory group</strong>) was originally defined to be the Grothendieck group of its symmetric monoidal category of projective modules. Under the relation between modules and vector bundles, this is directly analogous to the basic definition of topological K-theory, whence the common term. (In fact when applied to the <strong>stack of vector bundles</strong> then algebraic K-theory subsumes topological K-theory and also differential K-theory.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Quillen <span lang=\"zh\">定义了环</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">的高阶</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/K-群","text":"K-<span lang=\"zh\">群</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>)"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">它是某个空间</span> $BGL(R)^+$ <span lang=\"zh\">的同伦群</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}